{"cycle": 0, "dreams": ["1. What is the name of the second highest ranking paramount chief? Answer: Malietoa Tanumafili II\n2. How many of the highest ranking paramount chiefs are there? Answer: four\n3. What was Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole's profession? Answer: head of state\n4. What is the name of the Head of State that died in 2007? Answer: Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n5. What was the name of the head of state before Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi? Answer: Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole\n6. When did the Head of State die? Answer: 11 May 2007\n7. What is the name of the last Head of State? Answer: Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n8. What was the name of the third highest ranking paramount chief? Answer: Malietoa Tanumafili II\n9. How many years did the next Head of State serve for? Answer: five\n10. What was the name of the election? Answer: for a fixed five-year term", "1. Which Samoan was the first Prime Minister? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. Who was his fellow paramount chief? Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole\n3. Who was the last? Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n4. When did he die? 11 May 2007\n5. How long was his tenure? Life\n6. Who was elected to replace him? Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n7. How many years did his tenure last? 5\n8. What was the name of the next Head of State? Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n9. When did he take office? 17 June 2007\n10. Who appointed him? Samoa's legislature\n11. Was he re-elected? Yes\n12. What was his name? Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n13. What was his title? Head of State\n14. When did he die? 11 May 2007\n15. Who was his successor? Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n16. How many years was his tenure? 5", "1. What is the nationality of the first Prime Minister?\n2. Who was the only other?\n3. Who was the head of state in 2007?\n4. How many years did the original last?\n5. How many heads of state did Samoa have at one time?\n6. Did they have a fixed term?\n7. What did they change to?\n8. What was the name of the new one?\n9. And the next?\n10. Who was the next?\n11. How long was his term?\n12. What happened to the previous one in 2007?\n13. What is the nationality of the current one?\n14. What is his title?\n15. Is he the first to have that title?\n16. What is his title?\n17. When was he elected?\n18. How many years before that did he die?\n19. What was his title before he died?\n20. How many supreme chiefs were there when the country was founded?\nAnswer: 1. Samoan\n2. Tupua Tamasese\n3. Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n4. Life\n5. Four", "1. Who was one of the four highest-ranking paramount chiefs?\nFiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II.\n\n2. What was the name of the other three?\nTupua Tamasese Mea'ole, Malietoa Tanumafili II and Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi.\n\n3. When did he die?\n11 May 2007.\n\n4. What was the title of the next Head of State?\nTuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi.\n\n5. How long was his term?\nA fixed five-year term.\n\n1. Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole, Malietoa Tanumafili II and Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi.\n3. 11 May 2007\n4. Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi.\n5. A fixed five-year term.", "Question: What was the title of Tupua Tamasese Efi? Leader of state. OPTIONS:\n- Yes\n- No\n-\nA: Yes", "1. What was the name of the highest ranking chiefs in Samoa? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu\u2019u II\n2. What is the name of the highest chief in Samoa? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu\u2019u II\n3. What was the name of the person who became Samoa's first Prime Minister? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n\nAnswer: 1. Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole\n3. Malietoa Tanumafili II\n\n1. Who is the current head of state? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. What is the name of the head of state? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n3. What is the name of the current prime minister? Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n\nAnswer: 1. Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. Tupua Tamasese Mea", "1. Who was the first to become Prime Minister? answer: Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. When did he become Prime Minister? answer: 1960\n3. Who was the first person to become Head of State? answer: Malietoa Tanumafili II\n4. How long did he serve? answer: until his death in 2007\n5. Who was elected to be the next Head of State? answer: Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n\nStudent: 1. Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. 1960\n3. Malietoa Tanumafili II\n4. 1963\n5. Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi\n\nProblem: Passage: The second-largest higher-education institution in the city is City University, which has a student population of about 50,000 -- 60,000 full- and part-time students. City has a campus in Queens, City University of New York (CUNY), and another in Mainz, Germany (the European University at Mainz). The European University at Mainz is a partner university of CUNY", "1. Who was appointed as Prime Minister of Samoa?\n2. What was his title?\n3. What were the other three names?\n4. What was his rank?\n5. What happened to the other three?\n6. What did Malietoa Tanumafili II die of?\n7. How many people are now head of state in Samoa?\n8. Who?\n9. What was his rank?\n10. What is his title?\n11. Who was the next head of state?\n12. Who was elected?\n13. When was the election?\n14. How long was his term?\n15. What is his title?\n16. What was the previous title?\n17. When did Tuiatua Tupua Tamasese Efi die?\n18. What does his name translate to?\n19. What happened on the 12th of May, 2007?\n20. What was the next year that he was re-elected?\n\nNumbered questions:\n1. Fiame Mata'afa Faumuina Mulinu'u II\n2. Prime Minister\n3. Tupua Tamasese Mea'ole\n4"], "passage": 0, "stage": "dreams", "t": 1793289332.941707}
